Usage: agent-deck remote update [name | --all]

Updates every remote that is older than this controller (<VERSION>) when no name is given.
Exit status is 1 when any remote failed.

Options:
  --all
        Update every configured remote that is older than this controller
  --from-build string
        Install release-layout archives from a local directory
  --force
        Allow reinstalling or downgrading
  --dry-run
        Verify artifacts and show destination paths without installing
  --json
        Output every result as JSON
